# ★ Editor/agent backup copies. Two of these (spawn.rs.bak, theme.rs.bak) were
# committed by accident and sat in the source tree behind HEAD — spawn.rs.bak
# was missing the `disown_children()` call that stops the compositor leaking
# unreaped children, so a reader who opened the wrong file would have read a
# version of the process-spawn invariant that does not hold. Ignored here so
# the class cannot recur rather than removed one instance at a time.
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
